<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post6739451499163878484..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: They Call That Scam &quot;Sharia&quot;</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6739451499163878484/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/03/they-call-that-scam-sharia.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>17</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2960095000897075403</id><published>2011-03-05T22:12:05.309-07:00</published><updated>2011-03-05T22:12:05.309-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Well, Will. As usual, you don&amp;#39;t&#xa; pull any punc...</title><content type='html'>Well, Will. As usual, you don&amp;#39;t&lt;br /&gt; pull any punches exposing the standard bearers of BS.It never ceases to amaze. Keep it up, my vigilant friend.&lt;br /&gt;Billy</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6739451499163878484/comments/default/2960095000897075403'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6739451499163878484/comments/default/2960095000897075403'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/03/they-call-that-scam-sharia.html?showComment=1299388325309#c2960095000897075403' title=''/><author><name>Billy</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/03/they-call-that-scam-sharia.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6739451499163878484' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6739451499163878484' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2122285628"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 5, 2011 at 10:12 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1405660243105062294</id><published>2011-03-04T13:21:55.732-07:00</published><updated>2011-03-04T13:21:55.732-07:00</updated><title type='text'>THOUGHT FOR TODAY:&#xa;&#xa;The authority of the State can...</title><content type='html'>THOUGHT FOR TODAY:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The authority of the State can never be an end in itself; for if that were so, any kind of tyranny would be inviolable and sacred.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;If a government uses the instruments of power in its hands for the purpose of leading a people to ruin, rebellion is not only the right, but also the duty, of every individual citizen.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Every government, even though it be the worst possible, and even though it may have betrayed the nation’s trust in thousands of ways, will claim that its duty is to uphold the authority of the State. Its adversaries, who are fighting for national self-preservation, must use the same weapons which the government uses if they are to prevail against such a rule, and secure their own freedom and independence. Therefore the conflict will be fought with &amp;quot;legal&amp;quot; means as long as the power which is to be overthrown uses them; but the insurgents will not hesitate to employ illegal means if the oppressor himself uses them.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Generally speaking, we must not forget that the highest aim of human existence is not the maintenance of a State of Government, but rather the preservation of the human race.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Only on the recognition of this principle was it possible for those struggles to be carried through, of which history furnishes magnificent examples in abundance, against foreign bondage or oppression at home.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Human rights are above the rights of the State. But if a people be defeated in the struggle for its human rights, this means that its weight has proved too light in the scale of Destiny to have the luck of being able to endure in this material world.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The world is not there to be possessed by the faint-hearted races.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; - Adolf Hitler, &amp;quot;Mein Kampf&amp;quot;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6739451499163878484/comments/default/1405660243105062294'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6739451499163878484/comments/default/1405660243105062294'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/03/they-call-that-scam-sharia.html?showComment=1299270115732#c1405660243105062294' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/03/they-call-that-scam-sharia.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6739451499163878484' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6739451499163878484' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1824226115"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 4, 2011 at 1:21 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3869155373284527837</id><published>2011-03-03T21:23:14.457-07:00</published><updated>2011-03-03T21:23:14.457-07:00</updated><title type='text'>The following comment from this blog post proves I...</title><content type='html'>The following comment from this blog post proves I live in Bizzaro World:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;During the past decade, only one formerly secular country fell under the rule of sharia law: Iraq. This wasn&amp;#39;t done by al-Qaeda, the Muslim Brotherhood, CAIR, or any of the other Islamist groups that torment the dreams of people suffering from toxic levels of exposure to the War Party&amp;#39;s propaganda; it was done by the government afflicting the United States of America.&amp;quot; &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;That so many People don&amp;#39;t see this for what it is,... just amazes me. Everywhere I look all I see are butts sticking up in the air and heads buried in the sand oblivious to everything that is going on.&lt;br /&gt;With the exception of those who write here and similar websites, I&amp;#39;m soo disappointed in my fellow Americans, I hardly knew ya.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Is the War on Some Drugs being replaced by a War Against Some Religions?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;That&amp;#39;s the feeling I got after reading this blog and this article:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://www.lewrockwell.com/orig7/gabb6.1.1.html&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Also, DK, the &amp;quot;Clash of Civilizations&amp;quot; is anything but a sham to convince White - and Brown and Black - America of the need to kill brown people, occupy their countries, and take their stuff. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;You might be shocked at the number of &amp;quot;dark skinned&amp;quot; People who support the war on taking stuff. I know I am.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;in TODAY&amp;#39;S world, being a terrorist implies (with about a 95% accuracy rate) that one is a power thug, a.k.a. cops, judges, lawyers and most politicians all are bent on control of others against their will.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It is the GOVERNMENT ITSELF which is the biggest terrorist against its own people, and the biggest instigator of chaos and lawlessness.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6739451499163878484/comments/default/3869155373284527837'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6739451499163878484/comments/default/3869155373284527837'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/03/they-call-that-scam-sharia.html?showComment=1299212594457#c3869155373284527837' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/03/they-call-that-scam-sharia.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6739451499163878484' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6739451499163878484' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-713967348"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 3, 2011 at 9:23 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6959104954608289755</id><published>2011-03-03T20:12:46.679-07:00</published><updated>2011-03-03T20:12:46.679-07:00</updated><title type='text'>It&amp;#39;s easy to make fun of patriotic Americans w...</title><content type='html'>&lt;i&gt;It&amp;#39;s easy to make fun of patriotic Americans who are trying to do something about Sharia by overreacting, but the truth is that Sharia is based on the Quran being the absolute truth, and anybody who disagrees with it being damned to Hell.As such it can never be allowed to take root in our legal system.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;A century ago, &amp;quot;patriotic Americans&amp;quot; whipped into a froth over the &amp;quot;Papist menace&amp;quot; said &lt;i&gt;exactly&lt;/i&gt; the same thing about the Roman Catholic Church. After all, the Pope is both a head of state and the pontiff of a world-spanning religion, one claiming to be the divinely appointed vessel of &amp;quot;absolute truth,&amp;quot; and one insisting that &lt;br /&gt;&lt;i&gt;extra ecclesiam nulla salus&lt;/i&gt; (outside the Church there is no salvation).&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;i&gt;...every Muslim immigrating from the Muslim world brings it with him, although in that world it controls everything, and in America it initially just controls him.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;This is another retread theme: We gotta cut off the flow of Micks, Spics, Dagoes, and other Papist immigrants until we can &amp;quot;Americanize&amp;quot; the ones already here. That&amp;#39;s why, back in the late 19th and early 20th centuries, humanists and nativists tag-teamed the parochial school system, thereby helping create the charming unionized government school system we have today.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6739451499163878484/comments/default/6959104954608289755'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6739451499163878484/comments/default/6959104954608289755'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/03/they-call-that-scam-sharia.html?showComment=1299208366679#c6959104954608289755' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='24' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-jPFv0cYu6Cc/TVtx6son2uI/AAAAAAAAHCU/52MmpBEjoEs/s220/New%2BProfile%2BPic.png'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/03/they-call-that-scam-sharia.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6739451499163878484' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6739451499163878484' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 3, 2011 at 8:12 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1427942180212143571</id><published>2011-03-03T19:04:23.018-07:00</published><updated>2011-03-03T19:04:23.018-07:00</updated><title type='text'>It&amp;#39;s easy to make fun of patriotic Americans w...</title><content type='html'>It&amp;#39;s easy to make fun of patriotic Americans who are trying to do something about Sharia by overreacting, but the truth is that Sharia is based on the Quran being the absolute truth, and anybody who disagrees with it being damned to Hell. As such it can never be allowed to take root in our legal system. Too bad, every Muslim immigrating from the Muslim world brings it with him, although in that world it controls everything, and in America it initially just controls him. The problem isn&amp;#39;t Sharia, it&amp;#39;s the Congress continuing to allow immigration from the Muslim world and not caring about the consequences. Congress needs to declare a moratorium unless/until the Muslim world changes by dethroning Islam as its official religion and opening up to other religions, for starters. Read the Historyscoper&amp;#39;s Islam Watch Blog: http://tinyurl.com/islamwatch</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6739451499163878484/comments/default/1427942180212143571'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6739451499163878484/comments/default/1427942180212143571'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/03/they-call-that-scam-sharia.html?showComment=1299204263018#c1427942180212143571' title=''/><author><name>T.L. Winslow (TLW), the Historyscoper (tm)</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13821885034444628101</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='27' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/_Hud3LpvBlK8/SjsURHWgbbI/AAAAAAAAABE/P98zB4YYPa4/S220/god_angry.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/03/they-call-that-scam-sharia.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6739451499163878484' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6739451499163878484' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1884462118"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 3, 2011 at 7:04 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1566228625124452727</id><published>2011-03-03T15:36:29.387-07:00</published><updated>2011-03-03T15:36:29.387-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Well, it seems that Anjem Choudary&amp;#39;s pro-shari...</title><content type='html'>Well, it seems that Anjem Choudary&amp;#39;s pro-sharia rally has been cancelled. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://www.salon.com/news/islam/index.html?story=/politics/war_room/2011/03/03/sharia_protest_cancelled&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Who could have possibly seen this coming?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I guess Glenn and company will have to find some other pathetic media whore to promote as the next face of the coming Islamic caliphate.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6739451499163878484/comments/default/1566228625124452727'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6739451499163878484/comments/default/1566228625124452727'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/03/they-call-that-scam-sharia.html?showComment=1299191789387#c1566228625124452727' title=''/><author><name>Cody</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/03/they-call-that-scam-sharia.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6739451499163878484' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6739451499163878484' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-65275522"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 3, 2011 at 3:36 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8630147764092170450</id><published>2011-03-03T04:51:07.194-07:00</published><updated>2011-03-03T04:51:07.194-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Q: What do you call 1,000 Republican politicians c...</title><content type='html'>Q: What do you call 1,000 Republican politicians chained together with 1,000 Democratic politicians at the bottom of the ocean?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;A: A good start.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6739451499163878484/comments/default/8630147764092170450'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6739451499163878484/comments/default/8630147764092170450'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/03/they-call-that-scam-sharia.html?showComment=1299153067194#c8630147764092170450' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/03/they-call-that-scam-sharia.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6739451499163878484' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6739451499163878484' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1824226115"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 3, 2011 at 4:51 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8525044729739643186</id><published>2011-03-02T21:25:06.281-07:00</published><updated>2011-03-02T21:25:06.281-07:00</updated><title type='text'>In all these present revolutions across the Arab w...</title><content type='html'>In all these present revolutions across the Arab world, the common people, the revolutionaries, are the ones maintaining basic law and order. That is, respect for private property and the physical safety of non-combatants. In Benghazi, the police have run away into hiding. Young civilian men are guarding ATM machines and shops to prevent looting. University professors and engineers have come forward to volunteer as unpaid bureaucrats to keep society running. Non-combatants bring food, water and bandages for the fighters. These, these very people, THESE are the &amp;quot;evil Mussulman jihadis&amp;quot; our elite-run media has taught us to hate - people, we were told, who hate freedom and worship slavery. Think about that for a minute.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;In every single case, miraculously almost without exception, in all these uprisings, it has been the government forces which have attacked property, used violence against reporters, civilians, and foreigners, stolen their last rags from miserable fleeing refugees, and instigated chaos and mayhem.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Given our own 10-year history of false flag &amp;quot;terrorist&amp;quot; operations instigated by our own US Government, including 9-11-01 itself, it is absolutely clear to me that governments everywhere try to legitimize their power and oppression of the mundanes by pretending that without them, everything would fall apart into chaos. This is a baldfaced lie. Look at the orderliness of the protesters in Wisconsin. Like the revolutionaries in Libya and elsewhere, they recognize that it is their own taxes that have paid for the public property they occupy, and they have refrained from damaging it in even the most trivial way. They have even gained the respect of the police (!!!) by their peaceful non-violence. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It is the GOVERNMENT ITSELF which is the biggest terrorist against its own people, and the biggest instigator of chaos and lawlessness.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Left to themselves, the vast majority of people IN EVERY COUNTRY are peaceful, and want nothing but to be left alone to  live their lives, feed their families, hug their children, and die peacefully in their beds at age 85.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It is only those bloodthirsty vampire &amp;quot;elites&amp;quot; who want to steal the fruits of their labor, and conscript them into wars to plunder the wealth of other nations, and to exert total power over the whole world, who prevent this blissful dream from becoming a reality.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Anyone who reads Mr. Grigg&amp;#39;s essay with care cannot fail to see these truths. And other examples are everywhere, if the reader simply maintains an open mind about the &amp;quot;news&amp;quot; of the past 10 years. Anyone, like &amp;quot;Anonymous&amp;quot; @1:25 PM, who fails to see it, is allowing their emotions to overcome their rational common sense, and thereby becoming a pawn of the Vampire State.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Shakespeare&amp;#39;s Hamlet:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;What a piece of work is Man! How noble in reason; How infinite in faculty; In form and moving&lt;br /&gt;how express and admirable! In action, how like an Angel; In apprehension, how like a God!&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;But there are a tiny minority who are two-legged hyenas, scavengers and killers, blood-suckers, maggots, foul leeches - it is these who create all the misery the world must endlessly endure. Most of them sit in &amp;quot;Government,&amp;quot; ruling by force and on pain of death over the rest of us peaceful slobs. Satan is the Lord of this world, and these &amp;quot;people&amp;quot; are his servants.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Satan is also, we are solemnly assured, the Prince of Lies. Let us not fall for His lies, and those of his bloodthirsty servants.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; - Lemuel Gulliver.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6739451499163878484/comments/default/8525044729739643186'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6739451499163878484/comments/default/8525044729739643186'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/03/they-call-that-scam-sharia.html?showComment=1299126306281#c8525044729739643186' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/03/they-call-that-scam-sharia.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6739451499163878484' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6739451499163878484' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1824226115"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 2, 2011 at 9:25 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7982239338078162787</id><published>2011-03-02T13:31:11.346-07:00</published><updated>2011-03-02T13:31:11.346-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Thanks to the sharia-compliant constitution West a...</title><content type='html'>Thanks to the sharia-compliant constitution West and his comrades inflicted on Iraq at gunpoint, Iraqi Christians are being driven from homes that were secure even under Saddam Hussein. Who is pushing what on whom, exactly? When did Hamze shed blood to advance sharia rule, as West did in Iraq?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Try to engage these issues as a thinking individual, rather than a talk radio bulimic.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6739451499163878484/comments/default/7982239338078162787'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6739451499163878484/comments/default/7982239338078162787'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/03/they-call-that-scam-sharia.html?showComment=1299097871346#c7982239338078162787' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='24' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-jPFv0cYu6Cc/TVtx6son2uI/AAAAAAAAHCU/52MmpBEjoEs/s220/New%2BProfile%2BPic.png'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/03/they-call-that-scam-sharia.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6739451499163878484' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/67394514991